description.p:
(g) at least one fluid transport device (FTD) having bottoming cycle energy transport fluid (BCF) input (s) and bottoming cycle energy transport fluid (BCF) output (s); 

 - 21& - wherein said TCF supplies said TCE energy transport fluid (TCF) input (s) ; a combustible fuel (CF) supplies said TCE fuel and/or heat input (s) ; said TCE exhaust output (s) supplies said HRD exhaust input (s) ; one or more fuel and/or heat source (s) (CFB) supplies said HRD fuel and/or heat input (s); said HRD pressure fluid output (s) supplies said BCE pressure fluid input (s); said HRD ambient exhaust output (s) may be vented to the atmosphere (directly or indirectly) or may be recirculated by a FTD to said TCE input (s); said bottoming cycle engine (BCE) BCF output (s) is input to said heat exchanger BCF input (s); said heat exchanger (HEX) BCF output (s) is connected to said FTD input (s); and said FTD output (s) is connected to said HRD BCF input (s) ; and said BCE efficiency is improved by adjusting the rate of supplemental firing or addition of said CFB such that said pressure fluid is at a higher energy state than without the addition of said CFB. 

 - 2 \2> -
